   │
   ▼
Validate JWT
   │
   ▼
Extract Email
   │
   ▼
CustomUserDetailsService
   │
   ▼
Find User
   │
   ▼
SecurityContext
   │
   ▼
UserController
   │
   ▼
200 OK
