8️⃣ Test Invalid JWT

Change one character in your token.

For example:

eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9........XXXX

Call:

GET http://localhost:8080/user/hello

You should get:

401 Unauthorized

because the JWT signature is invalid.

9️⃣ Test Expired JWT

Your JwtService currently has:

private final long EXPIRATION_TIME =
        1000 * 60 * 60;

That means:

1000 ms × 60 × 60
       ↓
1 hour

So your JWT expires after 1 hour.

After expiration:

GET /user/hello
       ↓
JWT expired
       ↓
401 Unauthorized
